    "description": "<p>The Solar's Caste Mark blazes. She then casts solar fire from her weapon at her enemy. This Charm is a Melee-based attack. Its attack pool equals (Dexterity + Melee + Essence). It has a Range of (Essence x 10) yards and cannot exceed it. It cannot be blocked or dodged without the use of Charms or other magic. It ignores cover, including shields, but it cannot otherwise strike around obstacles. It deals lethal damage with a base damage, before adding attack successes, of (the Exalt's Strength + Willpower). It deals aggravated damage against creatures of darkness (see below).</p>",
